<title>USA: Meris Laboratories delisted from NASDAQ.</title>
<headline>Meris Laboratories delisted from NASDAQ.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meris Laboratories Inc said Monday its common stock had been delisted from the NASDAQ National Market due to its inability to meet minimum lising requirements.</p>
<p>It said its shares will continue to trade on the over-the-counter bulletin board.</p>
